<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 你写哪类程序</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>智能体的代码也是代码 —— 但它在哪跑</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", gap: 22, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", padding: 26, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23"}}>写</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 42, color: "#0F6E56", marginLeft: 28}}>✓</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginLeft: 28, flex: 1}}>智能体的代码也是代码——这个环节完全可以放在 Codex / Claude Code 里。</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", padding: 26, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23"}}>跑</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 48, color: "#A32D2D", marginLeft: 28}}>？</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginLeft: 28, flex: 1}}>谁来给它权限、谁来记它的每一步、它失败时停在哪？——是另一圈东西负责的。</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5}}>所以：你需要一个能真正运行 agent 的 harness 环境。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>27 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
